  "bodyHash": "hoyqrxDFVJE=",
  "content": "<p><strong>粒子雨</strong>將預設天氣替換為更美觀的粒子效果，並新增額外的霧、風和沙塵暴天氣效果。您甚至可以透過遊戲內設定選單新增或自訂天氣效果。</p><p>Fabric 版本需要 <strong>Fabric API。</strong></p><p>關於<strong>設定</strong>，請使用指令 <code>/particlerain</code> 或載入器的模組清單選單。</p><p>常見的<strong>相容性</strong>問題，請參閱 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparticle-rain%252f%2523teleports\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oan4xH5RvH0\" width=\"775\" height=\"450\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></p><p>如果嵌入影片無法運作，請使用直接連結：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%252fembed%252foan4xH5RvH0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/oan4xH5RvH0</a></span></p><h3>雨滴粒子</h3><p>以傾斜角度落下，彷彿被風吹拂。暴風雨時風速更強。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/e0224f09c643c6f23a2d918b13ce51f3f7b77056.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/e0224f09c643c6f23a2d918b13ce51f3f7b77056.gif\"></p><h3>雪花粒子</h3><p>落下時緩慢旋轉。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/d8ffb64861e7405ad69b1161dfc1839447c8ba9f.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/d8ffb64861e7405ad69b1161dfc1839447c8ba9f.gif\"></p><h3>沙塵暴</h3><p>塵土和灌木在沙漠及其他乾燥生態域中隨風飄揚。支援模組生態域，並會匹配下方方塊的顏色。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/c48b84e2365bcae6c11de1e0c59ef3afcabc7b25.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/c48b84e2365bcae6c11de1e0c59ef3afcabc7b25.gif\"></p><h3>生態域色調</h3><p>雨滴和水粒子會匹配生態域的水色調。在原版生態域中，色調不會這麼強烈。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/7022231f3fe77219004b9f4c5048eebf91965afb.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/7022231f3fe77219004b9f4c5048eebf91965afb.png\"></p><h3>水面漣漪</h3><p>雨水落在水面時出現，會匹配您資源包的解析度。（可設定）</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/8984bc251f2eeae49f12adb7bdd96c9b7599276f.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/8984bc251f2eeae49f12adb7bdd96c9b7599276f.gif\"></p><h3>水牆痕跡</h3><p>雨水擊中堅硬材質的牆壁時出現。（可設定在任何方塊上出現）</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/f2c6adb15f6e20529a018cec992de390d5c0c15c.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/f2c6adb15f6e20529a018cec992de390d5c0c15c.gif\"></p><h3>薄霧</h3><p>降雨後，滲入地表的濕氣會蒸發回空氣中，在地表上方形成霧氣雲團。這些霧氣也會在標記為 `#c:is_spooky` 和 `#c:is_wet/` 的生態域中自然出現。（同樣可設定）</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/1908ca46743f6e4c82b04eb93c991dfca734a43e.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/1908ca46743f6e4c82b04eb93c991dfca734a43e.png\"></p><h3>設定與自訂效果</h3><p>您可以為特定方塊和生態域創建各種大氣粒子效果，或透過內建設定選單編輯現有效果。</p><p>透過指令 `/particlerain` 或模組選單存取設定選單。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/791d2bd8057572a0745517f5adbedb957cd96aab.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/791d2bd8057572a0745517f5adbedb957cd96aab.png\"></p><h3><del>水窪</del></h3><p><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puddles-floods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">水窪功能已重新設計並作為獨立模組發布。</span></a></em></p><h2>其他連結</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PigCart/particle-rain/issues?q=is:issue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">問題追蹤器</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpigc.art%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Discord</span></a></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/PigCart/particle-rain/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更新日誌 / 版本資訊</a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparticle-rain%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">備用鏡像下載</span></a></li>\n</ul>",
